Third-party components
----------------------

1. NVIDIA open-gpu-kernel-modules

   The distributed binary embeds prebuilt NVIDIA kernel modules, and this
   repository contains patches against NVIDIA's open GPU kernel module source:

     src/embedded/50hx-v534/*.ko
     src/embedded/90hx-v67/*.ko
     experiments/*/patches/*.patch

   These are derived from NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules
   <https://github.com/NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules>, which is released under
   a dual MIT OR GPL-2.0 license. The MIT option is selected here.

   Upstream commits used:
     580.159.03  4dbb564094c7a73fe222b9b010d7782638643c65
     610.43.03   452cec62d827034798072827d3866d1881662b77

   The corresponding upstream copyright notice and MIT permission notice apply
   to those components and are retained. NVIDIA is not affiliated with this
   project and does not endorse it.

2. WebForks/cmpunlocker

   <https://github.com/WebForks/cmpunlocker>, pinned commit
   970385136f87597fafeeaee3527816cc5f4a8701.

   No source code from that project is used or derived from here. Only factual
   identification data - stock firmware file sizes, SHA-256 digests and PCI
   device IDs - was independently recorded in src/compat.rs for the purpose of
   recognizing unmodified vendor firmware.


